            "text": "🌐 Join us for a webinar: «Navigating an Evolving AI Landscape.» \n\nAs AI capabilities and technologies become ever more mainstream, it has become increasingly critical for accelerators and VC firms to know how to separate the hype from the real deal when it comes to startups. Astana Hub is a part of Microsoft for Startups Champion Network.\n\n🚀 Join us as we delve into the complexities of and best practices for evaluating AI startups in a series of sessions led by Microsoft for Startups CTO-in-Residence and AI industry expert Amit Svarzenberg.\n\nDiscussion topics will cover:\n▫️ The current AI landscape;\n▫️ Criteria for evaluating the technical sophistication of AI solutions;\n▫️ Essential tools for conducting due diligence with startup founders;\n▫️ Each talk will be followed by a Q&A session during which attendees can ask questions about real-world scenarios and specific situations.\n\n⏰ June 13 at 14:00.\n\n❗️ Register via the link in bio."
